Package: skillgapR
Title: Analyze Job Market Skill Demand Using the JSearch API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Avalvir", "Sekhon", email = "avaksekhon@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
    An R package that wraps the JSearch REST API to retrieve job postings
    and analyze job market skill demand using a canonical skill dictionary.
    The package provides high-level functions for data retrieval, analysis,
    and visualization.
